  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help to give colour where the sound is missed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raise awareness and educate the population on hearing health issues is a constant task. We believe that one of the best ways to do this is to teach about it from the earliest ages. For this purpose, before 2023 ends, we want to print 5000 copies of the coloring book for children, where they can learn diferents ways to take care of their hearing.  We will be glad to count with your support in this projects, to make visible the importance of hearing health in our society.</narrative>
  </description>
